          {title:'What to know before hiring a handyman in PA', sub:'Pennsylvania does not require a general handyman license for repairs under $5,000, but contractors doing plumbing, electrical, or HVAC work must hold trade-specific licenses. Always ask for proof of insurance.', tag:'Guide'},
