        label: 'Temple \u2014 community resources & what to know',
        items: [
          {title:'How to spot storm damage before a contractor does', sub:'After heavy rain or hail, check gutters for granule buildup, look for lifted flashing around chimneys, and photograph any visible cracks. Document everything before calling a roofer.', tag:'Guide'},
          {title:'PA Attorney General \u2014 storm chaser contractor warnings', sub:'After major storms, predatory roofers work door-to-door in Philly neighborhoods. The AG\u2019s office maintains a roofing contractor complaint database and issues seasonal consumer alerts.', tag:'Rights'},
