          {title:'H.B. 2201 \u2014 Roofing Contractor Registration Act (PA, 2026)', sub:'Introduced February 2026. Would create statewide roofing contractor registration, require $100,000 liability insurance, and establish a consumer protection fund for failed roofing projects.', tag:'Bill \u00b7 State'},
          {title:'Philadelphia Green Roof Tax Credit \u2014 stormwater billing reduction', sub:'PWD offers a Stormwater Management Incentives Program with grants and bill credits for green roof installation. Residential properties can receive up to 100% reduction in impervious surface charge.', tag:'Program'}
