          {title:'Federal Investment Tax Credit \u2014 30% back on home battery & solar installations', sub:'IRA Section 25D credit covers solar panels and battery storage installed on your primary residence. Applies to both purchase and installation costs. Claimed on federal Form 5695.', tag:'Federal'},
          {title:'Philadelphia Electrical Code \u2014 knob-and-tube wiring prohibition in renovations', sub:'Philadelphia Building Code prohibits energizing or extending existing knob-and-tube wiring when a property undergoes renovation requiring permits. L&I inspectors flag it during permit review.', tag:'City ordinance'}
