          {title:'Philadelphia Bill No. 230458 \u2014 Longtime Owner Occupant Program (LOOP) expansion', sub:'2023 ordinance expanded LOOP eligibility to homeowners with incomes up to 150% AMI. Caps real estate tax increases for qualifying long-term owner-occupants who meet residency and income criteria.', tag:'City ordinance'},
          {title:'H.B. 2126 \u2014 Transfer on Death Deed Act (PA, 2024)', sub:'Signed into law 2024. Allows Pennsylvania homeowners to designate a beneficiary who automatically receives title upon death, avoiding probate. Can help families in gentrifying neighborhoods retain property.', tag:'Bill \u00b7 State'}
