          {title:'Philadelphia Bill No. 210112 \u2014 Pest Management Disclosure for rental units', sub:'Ordinance requires landlords to disclose any known pest infestation history at initial lease signing. Failure to disclose is grounds for lease termination without penalty under Philadelphia tenant law.', tag:'City ordinance'},
          {title:'PA Pesticide Control Act \u2014 licensing and consumer rights', sub:'All commercial pest control operators in PA must be licensed by PDA under the Pesticide Control Act of 1973. Consumers have the right to request the pesticide label and Safety Data Sheet before any application.', tag:'Rights'}
