        items: [
          {title:'Philadelphia moving day tips \u2014 permits, parking, and rowhome logistics', sub:'The City requires a moving truck parking permit from the Streets Department for any large vehicle parked in a no-parking zone during a move. Apply online at least 5 days in advance at phila.gov/permits.', tag:'How-to'},
          {title:'How to vet a moving company in Pennsylvania', sub:'PA movers must register with PUC and hold a PUC certificate. Verify at puc.pa.gov. Out-of-state movers need FMCSA registration. Never pay more than 10% over a binding estimate without an amended agreement.', tag:'Guide'},
