          {title:'Philadelphia Moving Truck Permit \u2014 Streets Department', sub:'City ordinance requires permits for moving trucks in restricted zones. Permits cost $20/day per block. Double-parking without a permit is subject to a $76 fine plus tow. Online application at phila.gov/streets.', tag:'City ordinance'},
          {title:'S.B. 419 \u2014 Moving Company Consumer Protection Act (PA, 2025)', sub:'Introduced March 2025. Would cap deposits at 10% of written estimate, require itemized invoices, and establish a dispute resolution process through the Office of Attorney General. In committee as of June 2026.', tag:'Bill \u00b7 State'}
