          {title:'How to find a dentist who accepts Medicaid in Philadelphia', sub:'Pennsylvania\u2019s Medicaid dental benefit (Medical Assistance) covers preventive, restorative, and emergency care for adults and children. Search participating providers at findahealthcenter.hrsa.gov or call 1-800-348-4040.', tag:'Guide'},
          {title:'What to do if you receive a surprise medical bill in PA', sub:'Under PA Act 96 of 2020 and the federal No Surprises Act (2022), you are protected from surprise billing for emergency services and out-of-network providers at in-network facilities. File a complaint at insurance.pa.gov.', tag:'Rights'}
