          {title:'How to find a therapist who takes your insurance in Philadelphia', sub:'Psychology Today\u2019s therapist finder and Open Path Collective list Philadelphia therapists by insurance and sliding-scale fee. Community Behavioral Health (CBH) is the Medicaid behavioral health manager for Philadelphia \u2014 call 888-545-2600.', tag:'Guide'},
